# The bare `node_modules` pattern above matches that name anywhere in the
# tree, including this deliberate test fixture for codebase-file-access.ts's
# denied-segment rejection — without this negation the fixture file silently
# never gets committed (caught the hard way: it worked in the worktree that
# created it, on-disk, then vanished in every worktree that actually cloned
# the branch).
!src/lib/service/__tests__/fixtures/codebase-file-access/root/src/lib/service/node_modules/
